OL,3,GNEWSAArrest after rape reported at
OL,4,Arecreation ground
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested in connection
OL,7,Fwith an investigation into the rape of
OL,8,Fa woman at a recreation ground.
OL,10,FThames Valley Police said a woman, aged
OL,11,Fin her 20s, reported being attacked
OL,12,Fnear the junction of Horspath Road and
OL,13,FRupert Road in Oxford on Sunday at
OL,14,Fabout 22:00 GMT. The force said the
OL,15,Fvictim was being supported by specially
OL,16,Ftrained officers and a cordon was in
OL,17,Fplace in the Hollow Way recreation
OL,18,Fground.
OL,20,FThe force said a 33-year-old man from
OL,21,FOxford arrested on suspicion of rape
OL,22,Fremains in custody.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
